// CCS - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

// CCS is a calculus of communicating systems. Nothing is printed: a
// process offers a value on a channel and another process receives
// it. The greeting is the name of the channel, which is the only
// identifier in the system a human reads.
// Hello World!
// Greeter = Hello World! @Greet
// Receiver = ?x:Greet . 0
